==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|sadnesse}}, equivalent to {{af|en|sad|-ness}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsædnəs/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-sadness.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The state or [[emotion]] of being [[sad]].
#: {{syn|en|forlornness|melancholy}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} An event in one's [[life]] that causes sadness.
#: {{ux|en|She has experienced many '''sadnesses''' in her forty years.}}
#: {{syn|en|misfortune|woe}}

